Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(desktop):=20=E2=8C=98]=20/=20=E2=8C=98[=20s?=
 =?UTF-8?q?tep=20only=20to=20sessions=20with=20a=20status=20stripe=20(gree?=
